  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.6.0 adds semantic OSC 8 hyperlinks with deterministic RFC 3986 URI validation, bounded id-only parameters, canonical framing, bounded WriteHyperlinkAsync output, strict-LIFO TerminalHyperlinkLease scopes with nested outer-state restoration and retryable cleanup, lifecycle-safe close/re-entry across terminal suspend/resume, session-disposal closure, cross-platform security/order acceptance, focused documentation/sample coverage, and package-only net8/net9/net10 validation.",
